  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SAfAIDS Info/Dissemin</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SAfAIDS:Intensifying the Response 2010-2015 - SAfAIDS Info/Dissemin</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det &#xF6;vergripande syftet &#xE4;r att anv&#xE4;nda evidensbaserade sociala beteende strategier f&#xF6;r f&#xF6;r&#xE4;ndring kommunikation f&#xF6;r att p&#xE5;verka positivt beteende som kommer att bidra till att minska hiv-fall i s&#xF6;dra Afrika, minska risken och s&#xE5;rbarheter till HIV &amp; TB &amp; st&#xE4;rka kapaciteten hos individer och samh&#xE4;llen att hantera effekterna av epidemin. Meddelanden p&#xE5; hiv-prevention, v&#xE5;rd och st&#xF6;d &#xE4;r stressad</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall purpose is to use evidence based social behaviour change communication strategies to influence positive behaviour that will contribute to the reduction of HIV incidence in southern Africa, reduce risk &amp; vulnerabilities to HIV &amp; TB, &amp; strengthen the capacity of individuals &amp; communities to cope with the impacts of the epidemic. Messages on HIV prevention, care &amp; support are stressed</narrative>
  </description>
